         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v563
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v564
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v153" id="v153" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v153" tabindex="-1">v153</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v565
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir iam wart derwerket<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v154" id="v154" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v154" tabindex="-1">v154</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v566
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die hende hup si hohe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v155" id="v155" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v155" tabindex="-1">v155</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v567
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gein der phabize vrone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v156" id="v156" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v156" tabindex="-1">v156</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v568
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gein dem himleriche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v157" id="v157" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v157" tabindex="-1">v157</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v569
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si sprach vil tugentliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
