         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v571
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ouwe du gewaltiger got<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v159" id="v159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v159" tabindex="-1">v159</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v572
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mine vil innecliche not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v160" id="v160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v160" tabindex="-1">v160</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v573
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geruche zu bekennen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v161" id="v161" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v161" tabindex="-1">v161</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>io enmac ich nicht gewenken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v162" id="v162" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v162" tabindex="-1">v162</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich muoz liden was du wilt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v163" id="v163" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v163" tabindex="-1">v163</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>io hab ich angst vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v164" id="v164" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v164" tabindex="-1">v164</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wa mocht ich rast finden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v165" id="v165" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v165" tabindex="-1">v165</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do du mir an den kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
