         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>was du wilt das mus erge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v171" id="v171" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v171" tabindex="-1">v171</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die toten heiszt du uf ste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v172" id="v172" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v172" tabindex="-1">v172</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v591
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di armen machs du riche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v173" id="v173" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v173" tabindex="-1">v173</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v592
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in selben ungeliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v174" id="v174" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v174" tabindex="-1">v174</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v593
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di richen lestu vallen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v175" id="v175" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v175" tabindex="-1">v175</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v594
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des muzen si dir alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v176" id="v176" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v176" tabindex="-1">v176</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v595
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>grozer meisterschefte iehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v177" id="v177" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v177" tabindex="-1">v177</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v596
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wo dine ougen geruchen sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v178" id="v178" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v178" tabindex="-1">v178</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v597
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist gneidkeit mer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v179" id="v179" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v179" tabindex="-1">v179</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v598
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>danne griz in dem mer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v599
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v600
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v180" id="v180" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v180" tabindex="-1">v180</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v601
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diner gute manicvalde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v181" id="v181" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v181" tabindex="-1">v181</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v602
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>me danne zwige in dem walde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v182" id="v182" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v182" tabindex="-1">v182</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v603
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mugen gesin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v183" id="v183" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v183" tabindex="-1">v183</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v604
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>oder in dem mer vische gesin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v605
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v184" id="v184" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v184" tabindex="-1">v184</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v606
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gezalt hastu die sterne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v185" id="v185" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v185" tabindex="-1">v185</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v607
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si mugen dir dinen gne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v186" id="v186" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v186" tabindex="-1">v186</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v608
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der du wilt geruchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v187" id="v187" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v187" tabindex="-1">v187</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v609
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ledige mich von den flichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v188" id="v188" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v188" tabindex="-1">v188</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v610
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di mich hahen gederret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v189" id="v189" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v189" tabindex="-1">v189</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v611
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mine wammen gesperret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v190" id="v190" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v190" tabindex="-1">v190</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v613
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di scholtu herre ents<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v191" id="v191" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v191" tabindex="-1">v191</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v614
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich din heilikeit genize<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v192" id="v192" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v192" tabindex="-1">v192</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v615
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Anna suchte ir venien<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v193" id="v193" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v193" tabindex="-1">v193</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit zehern als manig<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v194" id="v194" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v194" tabindex="-1">v194</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v617
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> daz si got erhörte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v195" id="v195" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v195" tabindex="-1">v195</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v618
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir angst gar zustorte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v196" id="v196" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v196" tabindex="-1">v196</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v619
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5r/C2 do si nid genikte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v197" id="v197" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v197" tabindex="-1">v197</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v620
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nd wid ouf geblikte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v198" id="v198" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v198" tabindex="-1">v198</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v621
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in einen boumgartun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v199" id="v199" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v199" tabindex="-1">v199</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v622
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si hegende umme warten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v200" id="v200" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v200" tabindex="-1">v200</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v623
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und sach an eime aste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v201" id="v201" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v201" tabindex="-1">v201</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v624
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sperken schrie vaste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v202" id="v202" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v202" tabindex="-1">v202</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v625
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> si gahte zu eime neste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v626
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v203" id="v203" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v203" tabindex="-1">v203</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v627
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da si ire kint veste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v204" id="v204" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v204" tabindex="-1">v204</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v628
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und bracht in di spise<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v205" id="v205" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v205" tabindex="-1">v205</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v629
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf eime deinen rise<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v206" id="v206" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v206" tabindex="-1">v206</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v630
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf eime birnboume<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v207" id="v207" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v207" tabindex="-1">v207</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v631
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vrouwe nam des goume<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v208" id="v208" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v208" tabindex="-1">v208</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v632
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi vrolich si flugen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v209" id="v209" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v209" tabindex="-1">v209</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v633
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durch daz si iüge zugen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v634
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v635
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v210" id="v210" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v210" tabindex="-1">v210</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v636
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si sprach ouwe here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v211" id="v211" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v211" tabindex="-1">v211</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v637
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nahen und vre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v212" id="v212" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v212" tabindex="-1">v212</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v638
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ist din trost geleitet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v639
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v213" id="v213" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v213" tabindex="-1">v213</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v640
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>din gnade bereitet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v214" id="v214" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v214" tabindex="-1">v214</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v641
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor aller slachte kund<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v215" id="v215" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v215" tabindex="-1">v215</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v642
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du Stiftes michel wunder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v216" id="v216" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v216" tabindex="-1">v216</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v643
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durch daz du ob in allen bist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v217" id="v217" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v217" tabindex="-1">v217</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v644
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dine gesciiefte du gist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v218" id="v218" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v218" tabindex="-1">v218</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v645
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unmenschliche wune <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v219" id="v219" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v219" tabindex="-1">v219</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v646
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von regen und von sunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v220" id="v220" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v220" tabindex="-1">v220</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v647
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'machstu di erden b''nhaft'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v221" id="v221" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v221" tabindex="-1">v221</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v648
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den vogelin gibstu di kraft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v222" id="v222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v222" tabindex="-1">v222</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v649
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si ire kint meinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v223" id="v223" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v223" tabindex="-1">v223</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v650
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi si in d luft sweimen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v224" id="v224" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v224" tabindex="-1">v224</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v651
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'du gebu''tes den wilden tirn'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v652
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v225" id="v225" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v225" tabindex="-1">v225</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v653
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si ziehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v654
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v226" id="v226" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v226" tabindex="-1">v226</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v655
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di natere di da slifet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v227" id="v227" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v227" tabindex="-1">v227</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v656
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wa si ur kint begrifet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v228" id="v228" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v228" tabindex="-1">v228</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v657
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> si get in willeclichen bi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v229" id="v229" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v229" tabindex="-1">v229</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v658
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und bezeiget daz si sin muter si<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v230" id="v230" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v230" tabindex="-1">v230</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v659
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von dir di vische namen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v231" id="v231" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v231" tabindex="-1">v231</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v660
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Wucher und samen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v232" id="v232" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v232" tabindex="-1">v232</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v661
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di in deme wazere vlizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v233" id="v233" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v233" tabindex="-1">v233</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v662
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'diner gute si geni"''zen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v234" id="v234" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v234" tabindex="-1">v234</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v663
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> allez daz da ie wart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v235" id="v235" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v235" tabindex="-1">v235</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v664
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz hat din segen wol bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v236" id="v236" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v236" tabindex="-1">v236</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v665
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>' daz ez sich v''neuwet'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v237" id="v237" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v237" tabindex="-1">v237</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v666
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'waz kruch''t od'' fluget'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v238" id="v238" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v238" tabindex="-1">v238</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v667
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'uffe der erden od'' in dem wage'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v239" id="v239" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v239" tabindex="-1">v239</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu sage ich dir gnade<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v240" id="v240" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v240" tabindex="-1">v240</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du aleine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v241" id="v241" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v241" tabindex="-1">v241</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v670
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'so v''re hast gescheiden'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v242" id="v242" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v242" tabindex="-1">v242</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v671
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von allen sachen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v243" id="v243" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v243" tabindex="-1">v243</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v672
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di du hast derschaffen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v244" id="v244" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v244" tabindex="-1">v244</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v673
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von allen dingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v245" id="v245" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v245" tabindex="-1">v245</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v674
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di uz dem urspringen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v246" id="v246" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v246" tabindex="-1">v246</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v675
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5v/C2 dins gewalts sint bekumen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v247" id="v247" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v247" tabindex="-1">v247</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar üz hastu mich genumen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v248" id="v248" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v248" tabindex="-1">v248</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v677
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gesundert und gescheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v249" id="v249" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v249" tabindex="-1">v249</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des müz ich immer clage und weinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v250" id="v250" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v250" tabindex="-1">v250</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v679
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>E daz si di rede volsprach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v251" id="v251" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v251" tabindex="-1">v251</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>einen engel si gesach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v252" id="v252" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v252" tabindex="-1">v252</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v681
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor I irme antlizce sten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v253" id="v253" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v253" tabindex="-1">v253</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v682
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vorhte begunde si angen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v254" id="v254" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v254" tabindex="-1">v254</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v683
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si I widersaz oz harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v255" id="v255" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v255" tabindex="-1">v255</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v684
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do si begondc warte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v256" id="v256" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v256" tabindex="-1">v256</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v685
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an sim schojne vedoren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v257" id="v257" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v257" tabindex="-1">v257</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v686
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vr sin wr als ein wedele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v258" id="v258" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v258" tabindex="-1">v258</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v687
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> tut vor deme winde daz loup<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v688
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v689
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
