         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v264" id="v264" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v264" tabindex="-1">v264</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>spch der engel lichte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v265" id="v265" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v265" tabindex="-1">v265</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d alle dink von nichte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v266" id="v266" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v266" tabindex="-1">v266</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>konde wol gemachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v267" id="v267" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v267" tabindex="-1">v267</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d wil selber wacehn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v268" id="v268" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v268" tabindex="-1">v268</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über din reinez gebet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v269" id="v269" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v269" tabindex="-1">v269</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als d kunc ie tet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v270" id="v270" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v270" tabindex="-1">v270</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v708
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>a über alle di ir gemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v271" id="v271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v271" tabindex="-1">v271</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>keren an sine gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v272" id="v272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v272" tabindex="-1">v272</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do din alt man ioahim<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v273" id="v273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v273" tabindex="-1">v273</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v711
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als ich j dir kundigen bin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v274" id="v274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v274" tabindex="-1">v274</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v712
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd dir zu iungest ziot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v275" id="v275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v275" tabindex="-1">v275</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v713
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di gotis I gnade euch wirret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v276" id="v276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v276" tabindex="-1">v276</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v714
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du swanger wurde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v277" id="v277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v277" tabindex="-1">v277</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v715
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>keiser licher burde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v278" id="v278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v278" tabindex="-1">v278</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v716
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du treist unV dinen brüsten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v279" id="v279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v279" tabindex="-1">v279</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v717
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des dich wol mak gelüsten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v280" id="v280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v280" tabindex="-1">v280</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v718
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eine tochter here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v281" id="v281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v281" tabindex="-1">v281</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v719
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ja enwirt euch nimmermere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v282" id="v282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v282" tabindex="-1">v282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v720
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ur glich geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v283" id="v283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v283" tabindex="-1">v283</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v721
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si ist zu kunegi j erkorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v284" id="v284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v284" tabindex="-1">v284</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v722
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über allez himelischs her<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
