         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v724
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si schol gotis i sun geber<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v286" id="v286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v286" tabindex="-1">v286</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v725
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den vil heiligen crist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v287" id="v287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v287" tabindex="-1">v287</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
