         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1056
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1057
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1058
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v341" id="v341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v341" tabindex="-1">v341</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1059
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>9r/C2 … nicht mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v342" id="v342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v342" tabindex="-1">v342</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1060
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wurde gerauftbet sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v343" id="v343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v343" tabindex="-1">v343</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1061
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem libe und an der sele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v344" id="v344" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v344" tabindex="-1">v344</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1062
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als er des nachtes entslif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v345" id="v345" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v345" tabindex="-1">v345</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1063
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der engel in aber rief<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v346" id="v346" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v346" tabindex="-1">v346</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1064
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wes sumes tu dich ioachim<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v347" id="v347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v347" tabindex="-1">v347</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1065
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an stunt ich böte bin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v348" id="v348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v348" tabindex="-1">v348</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1066
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du müst varn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v349" id="v349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v349" tabindex="-1">v349</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1067
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du enwolles ez bewarn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1068
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v350" id="v350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v350" tabindex="-1">v350</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1069
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du müst des engeldon<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v351" id="v351" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v351" tabindex="-1">v351</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1070
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz anna nich vil selten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v352" id="v352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v352" tabindex="-1">v352</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1071
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nach dir weinen wirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1072
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v353" id="v353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v353" tabindex="-1">v353</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1073
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du weist wol daz j si gebirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v354" id="v354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v354" tabindex="-1">v354</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1074
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eine tochter gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v355" id="v355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v355" tabindex="-1">v355</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1075
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di ist in gotis hüte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v356" id="v356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v356" tabindex="-1">v356</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1076
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von ewo zu even<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v357" id="v357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v357" tabindex="-1">v357</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1077
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi schal ich dich dinos wrum vlehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1078
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1079
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v358" id="v358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v358" tabindex="-1">v358</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1080
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>An dorne andern morgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v359" id="v359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v359" tabindex="-1">v359</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1081
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do vliz er alle sorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v360" id="v360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v360" tabindex="-1">v360</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1082
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hub sich ouf bereite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v361" id="v361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v361" tabindex="-1">v361</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1083
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wolte nicht lenger bcite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v362" id="v362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v362" tabindex="-1">v362</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1084
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sagte sinen liiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v363" id="v363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v363" tabindex="-1">v363</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1085
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des cn gels wort zu düten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v364" id="v364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v364" tabindex="-1">v364</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1086
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d si riten alle geimeinene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1087
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v365" id="v365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v365" tabindex="-1">v365</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1088
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si vm weren engegene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v366" id="v366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v366" tabindex="-1">v366</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1089
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als daz vihe mohte gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v367" id="v367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v367" tabindex="-1">v367</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1090
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si spräche wolt ir da besten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v368" id="v368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v368" tabindex="-1">v368</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1091
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz müezt ir an si tun <br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1092
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v369" id="v369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v369" tabindex="-1">v369</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1093
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez were ein j michel missetun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v370" id="v370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v370" tabindex="-1">v370</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1094
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er also tete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v371" id="v371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v371" tabindex="-1">v371</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1095
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als im gekundel hete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v372" id="v372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v372" tabindex="-1">v372</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1096
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gewaltige böte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v373" id="v373" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v373" tabindex="-1">v373</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1097
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si rifen vaste hin zu gote<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v374" id="v374" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v374" tabindex="-1">v374</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1098
