         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doch mochten si alle wol enstan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v613" id="v613" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v613" tabindex="-1">v613</a>
