         </span>di wilden vögele und tier<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v621" id="v621" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v621" tabindex="-1">v621</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vissche und allez daz wunder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v622" id="v622" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v622" tabindex="-1">v622</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz in des mers gründe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v623" id="v623" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v623" tabindex="-1">v623</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>beide fluzet und swebet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v624" id="v624" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v624" tabindex="-1">v624</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz kruchet oder lebet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v625" id="v625" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v625" tabindex="-1">v625</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uffe I dem ertbodeme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v626" id="v626" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v626" tabindex="-1">v626</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>oder in den lüften obene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v627" id="v627" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v627" tabindex="-1">v627</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz muz mir bescheinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v628" id="v628" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v628" tabindex="-1">v628</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi ich in lob und meinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v629" id="v629" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v629" tabindex="-1">v629</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Vor gotis geburte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v630" id="v630" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v630" tabindex="-1">v630</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi gut di lute worchten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v631" id="v631" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v631" tabindex="-1">v631</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi heilig si do waren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v632" id="v632" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v632" tabindex="-1">v632</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1468
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di kint di si gebaren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1469
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1470
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v633" id="v633" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v633" tabindex="-1">v633</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1471
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und doch in den iarn war<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1472
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1473
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1474
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v634" id="v634" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v634" tabindex="-1">v634</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1475
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ist ir wol di schult<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v635" id="v635" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v635" tabindex="-1">v635</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1476
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>war umme wir daz meiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v636" id="v636" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v636" tabindex="-1">v636</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1477
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz di vaste und di vire<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1478
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1479
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v637" id="v637" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v637" tabindex="-1">v637</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1480
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in I gesezcet nicht enist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v638" id="v638" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v638" tabindex="-1">v638</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1481
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unz aller manne lezzist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v639" id="v639" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v639" tabindex="-1">v639</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1482
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si eriledigot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v640" id="v640" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v640" tabindex="-1">v640</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1483
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz engestlielier not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v641" id="v641" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v641" tabindex="-1">v641</a>
