         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1485
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz daz aptgrunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v643" id="v643" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v643" tabindex="-1">v643</a>
