         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1487
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di muzent dar keren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v645" id="v645" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v645" tabindex="-1">v645</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1488
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sulche und semeliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v646" id="v646" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v646" tabindex="-1">v646</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1489
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>arm und riche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v647" id="v647" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v647" tabindex="-1">v647</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1490
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do enwart kein gebeine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v648" id="v648" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v648" tabindex="-1">v648</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1491
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so lutter noch so reine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v649" id="v649" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v649" tabindex="-1">v649</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1492
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz daz mochte bewarn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v650" id="v650" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v650" tabindex="-1">v650</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1493
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si miisten alle dar varn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v651" id="v651" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v651" tabindex="-1">v651</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1494
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> mit manigem ser eibite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v652" id="v652" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v652" tabindex="-1">v652</a>
