         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz j der ewige schin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v654" id="v654" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v654" tabindex="-1">v654</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erblüte mitten under in<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v655" id="v655" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v655" tabindex="-1">v655</a>
