         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1500
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di tifen helle I entrante<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v658" id="v658" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v658" tabindex="-1">v658</a>
