         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v659" id="v659" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v659" tabindex="-1">v659</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1503
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und sine volgere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
