         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1504
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v660" id="v660" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v660" tabindex="-1">v660</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1505
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die dar inne waren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v661" id="v661" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v661" tabindex="-1">v661</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1506
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do hie got über di sincn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v662" id="v662" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v662" tabindex="-1">v662</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1507
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein michel licht liz schinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v663" id="v663" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v663" tabindex="-1">v663</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1508
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein groz berk tal und glast<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
