         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1509
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v664" id="v664" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v664" tabindex="-1">v664</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1510
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu höret wi des cruces ast<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v665" id="v665" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v665" tabindex="-1">v665</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1511
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und der vil heilige stam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v666" id="v666" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v666" tabindex="-1">v666</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1512
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der erlost wip und man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v667" id="v667" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v667" tabindex="-1">v667</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1513
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin der heillige aller heiligen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v668" id="v668" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v668" tabindex="-1">v668</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1514
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>beide sich und Ion<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v669" id="v669" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v669" tabindex="-1">v669</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1515
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'aller d'' werlde j erzeigete'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v670" id="v670" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v670" tabindex="-1">v670</a>
