         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1522
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sint musten wir uasten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v673" id="v673" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v673" tabindex="-1">v673</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1523
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und mit banvire<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v674" id="v674" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v674" tabindex="-1">v674</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1524
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eren di holden sine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v675" id="v675" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v675" tabindex="-1">v675</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1525
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di im lip karten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v676" id="v676" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v676" tabindex="-1">v676</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1526
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu gemisschelter marter<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v677" id="v677" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v677" tabindex="-1">v677</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1527
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und sulche werk worchten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v678" id="v678" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v678" tabindex="-1">v678</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1528
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si nicht envorhten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1529
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1530
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1531
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1532
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v679" id="v679" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v679" tabindex="-1">v679</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1533
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des libes wandelunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v680" id="v680" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v680" tabindex="-1">v680</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1534
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>moyses der junge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v681" id="v681" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v681" tabindex="-1">v681</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1535
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di da vor lebeten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v682" id="v682" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v682" tabindex="-1">v682</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1536
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi vil si tugende phlegeten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v683" id="v683" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v683" tabindex="-1">v683</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1537
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ge dult doch nimant beget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v684" id="v684" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v684" tabindex="-1">v684</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1538
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di an ir iargezit gestet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v685" id="v685" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v685" tabindex="-1">v685</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1539
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wanne si den nie gesahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v686" id="v686" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v686" tabindex="-1">v686</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1540
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des si zu herren iahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v687" id="v687" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v687" tabindex="-1">v687</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1541
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sint under uns gie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v688" id="v688" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v688" tabindex="-1">v688</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1542
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und sich crucigen lie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1543
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1544
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v689" id="v689" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v689" tabindex="-1">v689</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1545
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz alle heilikeit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v690" id="v690" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v690" tabindex="-1">v690</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1546
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wurde dester baz bereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v691" id="v691" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v691" tabindex="-1">v691</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1547
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und cristen licher ere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v692" id="v692" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v692" tabindex="-1">v692</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1548
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wurde dester mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v693" id="v693" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v693" tabindex="-1">v693</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1549
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>David und abraham<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v694" id="v694" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v694" tabindex="-1">v694</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1550
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di waren Fürsten lobesä<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v695" id="v695" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v695" tabindex="-1">v695</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1551
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ysaach und iosue<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v696" id="v696" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v696" tabindex="-1">v696</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1552
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iacob in der alten e<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v697" id="v697" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v697" tabindex="-1">v697</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1553
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und di to chter ysachar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v698" id="v698" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v698" tabindex="-1">v698</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1554
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di unser vrouwen gebar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v699" id="v699" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v699" tabindex="-1">v699</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1555
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und ir vater ioahim<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1556
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1557
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v700" id="v700" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v700" tabindex="-1">v700</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1558
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di hatten alle irn sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v701" id="v701" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v701" tabindex="-1">v701</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1559
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an got I gewendet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v702" id="v702" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v702" tabindex="-1">v702</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1560
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des enwurden si nicht geschendet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v703" id="v703" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v703" tabindex="-1">v703</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1561
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sint in himelriche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v704" id="v704" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v704" tabindex="-1">v704</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1562
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den engelen gelivhe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v705" id="v705" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v705" tabindex="-1">v705</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1563
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und da so gejvristet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v706" id="v706" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v706" tabindex="-1">v706</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1564
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz in nicht gebristet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v707" id="v707" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v707" tabindex="-1">v707</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1565
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wanne des aleine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v708" id="v708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v708" tabindex="-1">v708</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1566
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir si uz scheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v709" id="v709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v709" tabindex="-1">v709</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1567
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an unscrn hochgeziten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v710" id="v710" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v710" tabindex="-1">v710</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1568
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da I durch daz si muzen biten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v711" id="v711" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v711" tabindex="-1">v711</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1569
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gotis ledigunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1570
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1571
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v712" id="v712" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v712" tabindex="-1">v712</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1572
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in deme abgrunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v713" id="v713" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v713" tabindex="-1">v713</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1573
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit allem irni gezeume<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v714" id="v714" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v714" tabindex="-1">v714</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gerucket in di hohe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v715" id="v715" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v715" tabindex="-1">v715</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'dar si nu sint gct''uret'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v716" id="v716" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v716" tabindex="-1">v716</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von dem tuvele ungcruret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1579
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1580
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v717" id="v717" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v717" tabindex="-1">v717</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1581
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz heilige ingesinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v718" id="v718" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v718" tabindex="-1">v718</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1582
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor I haze noch vor nidc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v719" id="v719" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v719" tabindex="-1">v719</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1583
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uns armen ruche enpin den<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v720" id="v720" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v720" tabindex="-1">v720</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1584
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir si her nach vinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1585
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v721" id="v721" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v721" tabindex="-1">v721</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1586
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in den unzelliclilen eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v722" id="v722" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v722" tabindex="-1">v722</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1587
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir von disem enlende koren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v723" id="v723" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v723" tabindex="-1">v723</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1588
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nu V nemt dise lere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v724" id="v724" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v724" tabindex="-1">v724</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von der maget hcro<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v725" id="v725" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v725" tabindex="-1">v725</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> di I uns den heilant gebar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v726" id="v726" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v726" tabindex="-1">v726</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1591
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'gute herzet"'' nu hebet uch dar'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1592
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
