         </span>daz der kunik salomon<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v784" id="v784" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v784" tabindex="-1">v784</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1663
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>stifte durch daz gotis Ion<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v785" id="v785" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v785" tabindex="-1">v785</a>
