         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v786" id="v786" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v786" tabindex="-1">v786</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1666
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>e her begunde uf gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v787" id="v787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v787" tabindex="-1">v787</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1667
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geprodigit wart si witcn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v788" id="v788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v788" tabindex="-1">v788</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wanne si in den selben geziten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v789" id="v789" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v789" tabindex="-1">v789</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er beluchte als di sunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v790" id="v790" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v790" tabindex="-1">v790</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1670
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz I allem irm kunnde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
