         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v791" id="v791" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v791" tabindex="-1">v791</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> ir antlize und ir ougon<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v792" id="v792" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v792" tabindex="-1">v792</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1677
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> daz muzen ane schouwon<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v793" id="v793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v793" tabindex="-1">v793</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di lute mit vorchton<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v794" id="v794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v794" tabindex="-1">v794</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1679
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Wrt I andere vrouwen worchtcn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v795" id="v795" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v795" tabindex="-1">v795</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> linwat und syden <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v796" id="v796" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v796" tabindex="-1">v796</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1681
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir keine mochte orliden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v797" id="v797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v797" tabindex="-1">v797</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1682
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> der erweit also vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
