         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1685
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so diz kint in sinem spil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v799" id="v799" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v799" tabindex="-1">v799</a>
