         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1687
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia worchte si mit sinnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v801" id="v801" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v801" tabindex="-1">v801</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1688
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> allez des si begonde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1689
