         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v802" id="v802" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v802" tabindex="-1">v802</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1690
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz 1 di alten konde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v803" id="v803" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v803" tabindex="-1">v803</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1691
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmohte ir nicht engan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v804" id="v804" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v804" tabindex="-1">v804</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1692
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> des I nachtes ilte si uf stan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v805" id="v805" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v805" tabindex="-1">v805</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1693
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> daz si ir venien pflege <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v806" id="v806" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v806" tabindex="-1">v806</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1694
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gote si sich ergebe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v807" id="v807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v807" tabindex="-1">v807</a>
