         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gedahte si dar zu <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v811" id="v811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v811" tabindex="-1">v811</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> daz si ires gebetis hutte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v812" id="v812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v812" tabindex="-1">v812</a>
