         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nz an si dem in bize<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v815" id="v815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v815" tabindex="-1">v815</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> so di 1 vrouwen gazen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v816" id="v816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v816" tabindex="-1">v816</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'wider zu w''ke gesazen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v817" id="v817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v817" tabindex="-1">v817</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den 1 half si unz zu none<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v818" id="v818" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v818" tabindex="-1">v818</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
