         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si ir gebete spreche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v821" id="v821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v821" tabindex="-1">v821</a>
