         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1716
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gotis engel vil her<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v827" id="v827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v827" tabindex="-1">v827</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1717
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> er bra chte ouch ur daz himelbrot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v828" id="v828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v828" tabindex="-1">v828</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1718
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'daz er d'' kuneginne bot'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
