         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1724
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> waz man ir gab zu spis<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v832" id="v832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v832" tabindex="-1">v832</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1725
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gehilt di maf/&lt; wise<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v833" id="v833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v833" tabindex="-1">v833</a>
