         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1727
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> in di stat zu senden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v835" id="v835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v835" tabindex="-1">v835</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1728
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>al di samenunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v836" id="v836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v836" tabindex="-1">v836</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1729
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alt und junge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v837" id="v837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v837" tabindex="-1">v837</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1730
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> di wurden do wol innen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v838" id="v838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v838" tabindex="-1">v838</a>
