         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1732
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> di si mit den egelen hatte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v840" id="v840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v840" tabindex="-1">v840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1733
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'si selbe ez wol v''daget'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v841" id="v841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v841" tabindex="-1">v841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1734
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>' doch was ez unv'' borgen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v842" id="v842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v842" tabindex="-1">v842</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1735
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmocht si nicht besorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v843" id="v843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v843" tabindex="-1">v843</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1736
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Heilige swestere wonten do<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v844" id="v844" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v844" tabindex="-1">v844</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1737
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> in salomonis tem plo<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v845" id="v845" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v845" tabindex="-1">v845</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1738
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di waren do gehoet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v846" id="v846" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v846" tabindex="-1">v846</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1739
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sider sint si gar zustoret <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v847" id="v847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v847" tabindex="-1">v847</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1740
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> nu habent ez besezen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v848" id="v848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v848" tabindex="-1">v848</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1741
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'rittere vil v''raezen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v849" id="v849" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v849" tabindex="-1">v849</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1742
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> di werend ez mit kreften<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v850" id="v850" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v850" tabindex="-1">v850</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1743
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'vor d'' heidenschefte'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
