         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v851" id="v851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v851" tabindex="-1">v851</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1746
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do di keilserinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v852" id="v852" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v852" tabindex="-1">v852</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1747
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di erweite gymme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v853" id="v853" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v853" tabindex="-1">v853</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1748
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'zuv''siht der w''lde '<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v854" id="v854" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v854" tabindex="-1">v854</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di ir den sal erweite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v855" id="v855" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v855" tabindex="-1">v855</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> daz si wolte erscheinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v856" id="v856" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v856" tabindex="-1">v856</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi 1 den heiligen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v857" id="v857" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v857" tabindex="-1">v857</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1752
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do lobte si unsern herren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v858" id="v858" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v858" tabindex="-1">v858</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1753
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'daz er si also v''ren'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v859" id="v859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v859" tabindex="-1">v859</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1754
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz den andern erhub<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1755
