         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1756
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si I senfticlichen trug<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v861" id="v861" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v861" tabindex="-1">v861</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1757
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle di erbeit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v862" id="v862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v862" tabindex="-1">v862</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di si zu gewon heit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v863" id="v863" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v863" tabindex="-1">v863</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1759
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hatten gesprochen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
