         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1762
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und nimant enmochte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v865" id="v865" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v865" tabindex="-1">v865</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1763
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> den iren sin erkunden noch ergrunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
