         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si ilte zu al Icn stunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v867" id="v867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v867" tabindex="-1">v867</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1769
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> zu gotis dienst<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
