         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1771
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'zu d'' ewigen genist'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v869" id="v869" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v869" tabindex="-1">v869</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1772
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si I was an alliz wandel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v870" id="v870" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v870" tabindex="-1">v870</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1773
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kuscher danne di andern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v871" id="v871" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v871" tabindex="-1">v871</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1774
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> ir kei ne was so wise<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v872" id="v872" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v872" tabindex="-1">v872</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1775
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si az di gotis spise<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v873" id="v873" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v873" tabindex="-1">v873</a>
