         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in geistlicher wete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v877" id="v877" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v877" tabindex="-1">v877</a>
