         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wachen und vasten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v878" id="v878" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v878" tabindex="-1">v878</a>
