         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'bleich od'' trübe'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v880" id="v880" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v880" tabindex="-1">v880</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des wudnert genuge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v881" id="v881" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v881" tabindex="-1">v881</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz beste het si derkorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v882" id="v882" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v882" tabindex="-1">v882</a>
