         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di zuht si umbe gurte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v884" id="v884" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v884" tabindex="-1">v884</a>
