         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do enmocht ich cristenlicher schar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v909" id="v909" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v909" tabindex="-1">v909</a>
