         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1867
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dannen kom vns di gewonheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v937" id="v937" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v937" tabindex="-1">v937</a>
