         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1950
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>81 sprach daz si nicht cnwolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v992" id="v992" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v992" tabindex="-1">v992</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1951
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und nimmer man gewinnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v993" id="v993" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v993" tabindex="-1">v993</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1952
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>werltlichen gefruren <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v994" id="v994" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v994" tabindex="-1">v994</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1953
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> ez duchte si so michel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
