         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1955
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si woltc wesen sicher<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v996" id="v996" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v996" tabindex="-1">v996</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1956
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> vor I mannis gebende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v997" id="v997" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v997" tabindex="-1">v997</a>
