         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1973
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si di magt geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1002" id="v1002" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1002" tabindex="-1">v1002</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> zu koufen sime kinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1003" id="v1003" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1003" tabindex="-1">v1003</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1975
