         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz daz kint lustsam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1013" id="v1013" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1013" tabindex="-1">v1013</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1990
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sime sune wurd undertan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1014" id="v1014" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1014" tabindex="-1">v1014</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1991
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> di mite er wegete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1015" id="v1015" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1015" tabindex="-1">v1015</a>
