         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1992
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez begöde in allen wol gevalle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1016" id="v1016" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1016" tabindex="-1">v1016</a>
