         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2008
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si spracli mit guten züchten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1025" id="v1025" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1025" tabindex="-1">v1025</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu wesct nicht ungenute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1026" id="v1026" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1026" tabindex="-1">v1026</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> lazet var diso spil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1027" id="v1027" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1027" tabindex="-1">v1027</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2011
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wäne ich nimmer 1 onwil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1028" id="v1028" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1028" tabindex="-1">v1028</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> dekeinon man gcewinnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1029" id="v1029" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1029" tabindex="-1">v1029</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'zu w''tliche dinigen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1030" id="v1030" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1030" tabindex="-1">v1030</a>
