         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3925
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3926
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3927
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3928
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3929
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3930
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1352" id="v1352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1352" tabindex="-1">v1352</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3931
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nimant konte getrigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1353" id="v1353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1353" tabindex="-1">v1353</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3932
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di got us allen luten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1354" id="v1354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1354" tabindex="-1">v1354</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3933
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erwelte um zu einer brute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1355" id="v1355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1355" tabindex="-1">v1355</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3934
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und di so hat gekindet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1356" id="v1356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1356" tabindex="-1">v1356</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3935
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si nimmer me gewinnet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1357" id="v1357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1357" tabindex="-1">v1357</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3936
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mochte der sun gesprechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1358" id="v1358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1358" tabindex="-1">v1358</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3937
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kein sin dink gezechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1359" id="v1359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1359" tabindex="-1">v1359</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3938
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wunste das er were<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1360" id="v1360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1360" tabindex="-1">v1360</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3939
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so schone und geneme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1361" id="v1361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1361" tabindex="-1">v1361</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3940
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als di lihte maget ist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1362" id="v1362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1362" tabindex="-1">v1362</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3941
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hette di manige list<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1363" id="v1363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1363" tabindex="-1">v1363</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3942
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>oder mochte si gekosen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1364" id="v1364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1364" tabindex="-1">v1364</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3943
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si wolte di himelrosen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1365" id="v1365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1365" tabindex="-1">v1365</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3944
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit schone übertreffen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1366" id="v1366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1366" tabindex="-1">v1366</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3945
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si sundert von den heffen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1367" id="v1367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1367" tabindex="-1">v1367</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3946
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den vil lutern win<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1368" id="v1368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1368" tabindex="-1">v1368</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3947
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und daz gute oley<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1369" id="v1369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1369" tabindex="-1">v1369</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3948
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns heilet unser sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1370" id="v1370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1370" tabindex="-1">v1370</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3949
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di uns geschlagen hat di schare<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1371" id="v1371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1371" tabindex="-1">v1371</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3950
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da von di sele dersturben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1372" id="v1372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1372" tabindex="-1">v1372</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3951
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ab ur vegrezzen wurden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1373" id="v1373" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1373" tabindex="-1">v1373</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3952
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du uns den arzt gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1374" id="v1374" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1374" tabindex="-1">v1374</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3953
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der uns den sichtum benam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1375" id="v1375" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1375" tabindex="-1">v1375</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3954
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Hi schult ir wizen unter u<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1376" id="v1376" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1376" tabindex="-1">v1376</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3955
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wo dise buchel alle dru<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3956
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1377" id="v1377" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1377" tabindex="-1">v1377</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3957
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di maget wil dos walteu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1378" id="v1378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1378" tabindex="-1">v1378</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz da kein kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1379" id="v1379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1379" tabindex="-1">v1379</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3959
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'wed'' kiuni{&gt; noch blint'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1380" id="v1380" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1380" tabindex="-1">v1380</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3960
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'ninjni'' wirt geborn'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1381" id="v1381" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1381" tabindex="-1">v1381</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'daz I ewiclicli si v''lorn'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1382" id="v1382" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1382" tabindex="-1">v1382</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si wolle ez selber vristeu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1383" id="v1383" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1383" tabindex="-1">v1383</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu I dem iungisteo<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1384" id="v1384" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1384" tabindex="-1">v1384</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so der lip mit manigem ser<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1385" id="v1385" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1385" tabindex="-1">v1385</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3967
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>scheidet von der sel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1386" id="v1386" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1386" tabindex="-1">v1386</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3968
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>welch wip reine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1387" id="v1387" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1387" tabindex="-1">v1387</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3969
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nicht hat wanne daz eine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1388" id="v1388" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1388" tabindex="-1">v1388</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist zwivel keine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1389" id="v1389" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1389" tabindex="-1">v1389</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si genist etteliohe teile<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3973
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1390" id="v1390" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1390" tabindex="-1">v1390</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>es ur gat an di not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1391" id="v1391" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1391" tabindex="-1">v1391</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di maget vluhet der tot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1392" id="v1392" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1392" tabindex="-1">v1392</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in welchem huse di sohrift gelit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1393" id="v1393" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1393" tabindex="-1">v1393</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der engel un manunge git<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1394" id="v1394" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1394" tabindex="-1">v1394</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3978
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di dar inne buwent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1395" id="v1395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1395" tabindex="-1">v1395</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3979
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und ur des getrawent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1396" id="v1396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1396" tabindex="-1">v1396</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3980
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von sant marien und von gote <br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3982
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1397" id="v1397" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1397" tabindex="-1">v1397</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3983
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si derwellent daz geböte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1398" id="v1398" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1398" tabindex="-1">v1398</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3984
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>allen frumen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1399" id="v1399" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1399" tabindex="-1">v1399</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3985
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si ez ab scriben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3986
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
