         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3988
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und senden ez zu minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1401" id="v1401" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1401" tabindex="-1">v1401</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3989
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in dem v… meringe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1402" id="v1402" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1402" tabindex="-1">v1402</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3990
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'v''re und nahen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1403" id="v1403" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1403" tabindex="-1">v1403</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3991
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da man ez gerne epfahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1404" id="v1404" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1404" tabindex="-1">v1404</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3992
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durch d* meide libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1405" id="v1405" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1405" tabindex="-1">v1405</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3993
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ma ur daran vorohtlich dine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1406" id="v1406" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1406" tabindex="-1">v1406</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3994
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Di magt sant marie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1407" id="v1407" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1407" tabindex="-1">v1407</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geruche di name drie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1408" id="v1408" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1408" tabindex="-1">v1408</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>um I uns arme bite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
