         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1409" id="v1409" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1409" tabindex="-1">v1409</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns ir sun gesetze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1410" id="v1410" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1410" tabindex="-1">v1410</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4011
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'zu d'' rechte ] haut in den rink'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1411" id="v1411" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1411" tabindex="-1">v1411</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so daz groze teydink<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1412" id="v1412" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1412" tabindex="-1">v1412</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu aller jun gest wirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1413" id="v1413" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1413" tabindex="-1">v1413</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'und d'' here huswirt'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1414" id="v1414" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1414" tabindex="-1">v1414</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4015
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit zorne beginnet \ scheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
