         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4016
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1415" id="v1415" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1415" tabindex="-1">v1415</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4017
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di libcn von den leiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1416" id="v1416" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1416" tabindex="-1">v1416</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4018
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine kint von de knech ten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1417" id="v1417" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1417" tabindex="-1">v1417</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4019
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sundert er vö den rechten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1418" id="v1418" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1418" tabindex="-1">v1418</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4020
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di ubeln von de guten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
