         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4026
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1419" id="v1419" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1419" tabindex="-1">v1419</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4027
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da schol danne cristis muter<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1420" id="v1420" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1420" tabindex="-1">v1420</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4028
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vaste helfende wesen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1421" id="v1421" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1421" tabindex="-1">v1421</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4029
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir holden genesen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1422" id="v1422" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1422" tabindex="-1">v1422</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4030
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und vil mauige dytwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1423" id="v1423" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1423" tabindex="-1">v1423</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4031
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di mit grozer truwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1424" id="v1424" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1424" tabindex="-1">v1424</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4032
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ligent an irn wzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1425" id="v1425" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1425" tabindex="-1">v1425</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4033
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wer mohte uns baz gebuzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1426" id="v1426" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1426" tabindex="-1">v1426</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4034
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di totlichc vorohte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1427" id="v1427" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1427" tabindex="-1">v1427</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4035
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und waz wir ie geworch tcn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1428" id="v1428" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1428" tabindex="-1">v1428</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4036
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in getelosen sinnen ?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1429" id="v1429" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1429" tabindex="-1">v1429</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4037
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu den selben teydingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1430" id="v1430" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1430" tabindex="-1">v1430</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4038
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'gelsitzet si bi d'' syten'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1431" id="v1431" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1431" tabindex="-1">v1431</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4039
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'dem kunige d'' so witen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
