         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1432" id="v1432" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1432" tabindex="-1">v1432</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4042
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>richtet mit gcwalte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1433" id="v1433" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1433" tabindex="-1">v1433</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4043
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enwirt niclit ufgchalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1434" id="v1434" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1434" tabindex="-1">v1434</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4044
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>allis daz wir ic gedachten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1435" id="v1435" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1435" tabindex="-1">v1435</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4045
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir hinnen brachten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1436" id="v1436" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1436" tabindex="-1">v1436</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4046
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ane biiz und ane bichte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1437" id="v1437" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1437" tabindex="-1">v1437</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4047
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'ez d''gat da nicht so lichte'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1438" id="v1438" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1438" tabindex="-1">v1438</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4048
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir uns beden ken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1439" id="v1439" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1439" tabindex="-1">v1439</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4049
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir enmuge da nicht gewcnken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1440" id="v1440" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1440" tabindex="-1">v1440</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4050
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller herczen tougen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1441" id="v1441" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1441" tabindex="-1">v1441</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4051
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'d'' enniugen wir nicht v''lougen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
