         </span>'daz er füre wid'' heim'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1494" id="v1494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1494" tabindex="-1">v1494</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in di burk zu nazareth<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1495" id="v1495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1495" tabindex="-1">v1495</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di mit grozem lobe stet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1496" id="v1496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1496" tabindex="-1">v1496</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in sant marien gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1497" id="v1497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1497" tabindex="-1">v1497</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar truk in sin gemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1498" id="v1498" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1498" tabindex="-1">v1498</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Sin gesinde und di megetin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1499" id="v1499" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1499" tabindex="-1">v1499</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di hi/en si willeku men sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1500" id="v1500" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1500" tabindex="-1">v1500</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4132
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wart vil uuol enpfan(on<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1501" id="v1501" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1501" tabindex="-1">v1501</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do stunt ez unlange<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1502" id="v1502" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1502" tabindex="-1">v1502</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wanno er des wart innc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1503" id="v1503" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1503" tabindex="-1">v1503</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4135
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'an d'' kiinoginine'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1504" id="v1504" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1504" tabindex="-1">v1504</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si ein lebendingcz kint truc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1505" id="v1505" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1505" tabindex="-1">v1505</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'do gewan h'' leides gnuc'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1506" id="v1506" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1506" tabindex="-1">v1506</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4138
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil michel wunder in des nam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1507" id="v1507" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1507" tabindex="-1">v1507</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4139
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi si I schölte dekeine man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1508" id="v1508" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1508" tabindex="-1">v1508</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4140
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'imm'' habe üb kumen'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1509" id="v1509" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1509" tabindex="-1">v1509</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4141
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di bider spise wart gezogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1510" id="v1510" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1510" tabindex="-1">v1510</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4142
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di ur von himele wart gesant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1511" id="v1511" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1511" tabindex="-1">v1511</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4143
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der engelisschen hant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1512" id="v1512" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1512" tabindex="-1">v1512</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4144
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der vil einvaltig man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1513" id="v1513" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1513" tabindex="-1">v1513</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4145
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hatte gedank und wan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1514" id="v1514" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1514" tabindex="-1">v1514</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4146
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si mit bösen sachen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1515" id="v1515" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1515" tabindex="-1">v1515</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4147
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu sulchen ungemachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1516" id="v1516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1516" tabindex="-1">v1516</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4148
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>were verraten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1517" id="v1517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1517" tabindex="-1">v1517</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4149
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vrouwe in alle baten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1518" id="v1518" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1518" tabindex="-1">v1518</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4150
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er mezelich clagete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1519" id="v1519" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1519" tabindex="-1">v1519</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4151
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und sich wol gehabete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1520" id="v1520" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1520" tabindex="-1">v1520</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4152
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si sagetö ur unschulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1521" id="v1521" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1521" tabindex="-1">v1521</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und swurn bi gotis hulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1522" id="v1522" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1522" tabindex="-1">v1522</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vil geistliche wip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1523" id="v1523" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1523" tabindex="-1">v1523</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4155
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di buten sele und lip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1524" id="v1524" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1524" tabindex="-1">v1524</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4156
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz nimant kome<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1525" id="v1525" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1525" tabindex="-1">v1525</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu der maget schone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1526" id="v1526" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1526" tabindex="-1">v1526</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4158
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit keime ungeverte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1527" id="v1527" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1527" tabindex="-1">v1527</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noch si des ni begerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1528" id="v1528" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1528" tabindex="-1">v1528</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz über die straze ginege<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1529" id="v1529" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1529" tabindex="-1">v1529</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und ie keine man enpfinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1530" id="v1530" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1530" tabindex="-1">v1530</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4163
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>oder ie gespreche kein wort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1531" id="v1531" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1531" tabindex="-1">v1531</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4164
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>werer hie da oder dort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1532" id="v1532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1532" tabindex="-1">v1532</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4165
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu 1 keine werltliche manne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1533" id="v1533" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1533" tabindex="-1">v1533</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4166
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si von danne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1534" id="v1534" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1534" tabindex="-1">v1534</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4167
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>not scholte liden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1535" id="v1535" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1535" tabindex="-1">v1535</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4168
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si mocht euch an ir libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1536" id="v1536" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1536" tabindex="-1">v1536</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kein wandel wizen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1537" id="v1537" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1537" tabindex="-1">v1537</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si hette sich gevlizen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1538" id="v1538" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1538" tabindex="-1">v1538</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4171
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol tugentlicher gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4172
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4174
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1539" id="v1539" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1539" tabindex="-1">v1539</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4175
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si kondc sich selber wol gehutc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1540" id="v1540" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1540" tabindex="-1">v1540</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4176
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ercn manik valt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1541" id="v1541" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1541" tabindex="-1">v1541</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4177
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit des üben gotis gewalt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1542" id="v1542" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1542" tabindex="-1">v1542</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4178
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Der alte mit dem barte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1543" id="v1543" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1543" tabindex="-1">v1543</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4179
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>begonde sufczon harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1544" id="v1544" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1544" tabindex="-1">v1544</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4180
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin leit und sin ungcmach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1545" id="v1545" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1545" tabindex="-1">v1545</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu den vrouwe er do sprach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
