         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1546" id="v1546" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1546" tabindex="-1">v1546</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4183
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz trostes muget ir mir geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1547" id="v1547" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1547" tabindex="-1">v1547</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia muget ir [ selber wol sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1548" id="v1548" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1548" tabindex="-1">v1548</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4185
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si kindes swanger ist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1549" id="v1549" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1549" tabindex="-1">v1549</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4186
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>war zu sch ol der üppige list<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1550" id="v1550" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1550" tabindex="-1">v1550</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir mich wollet trigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
