         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4192
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1551" id="v1551" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1551" tabindex="-1">v1551</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4193
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>io be t\vinget si di wige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1552" id="v1552" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1552" tabindex="-1">v1552</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4194
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nimant ist so tummer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1553" id="v1553" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1553" tabindex="-1">v1553</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4195
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so alt noch so junger<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1554" id="v1554" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1554" tabindex="-1">v1554</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4196
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er enmuge di rechte warheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1555" id="v1555" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1555" tabindex="-1">v1555</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4197
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und min vil innenclichez leit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1556" id="v1556" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1556" tabindex="-1">v1556</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol schouwe und kisen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1557" id="v1557" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1557" tabindex="-1">v1557</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mochte ich nu verlisen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1558" id="v1558" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1558" tabindex="-1">v1558</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4200
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit rechten dingen mine lip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4201
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1559" id="v1559" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1559" tabindex="-1">v1559</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich ] nu tot were<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
