         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4216
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4217
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1560" id="v1560" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1560" tabindex="-1">v1560</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4218
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>weite got in sine gnade<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1561" id="v1561" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1561" tabindex="-1">v1561</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4219
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mine sele wider nemen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1562" id="v1562" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1562" tabindex="-1">v1562</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4220
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz mac ich zu antwort geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1563" id="v1563" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1563" tabindex="-1">v1563</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4221
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>de 1 unsern lichteren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1564" id="v1564" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1564" tabindex="-1">v1564</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4222
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'di werdent uns gen''e'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1565" id="v1565" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1565" tabindex="-1">v1565</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so daz kint her wer gat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1566" id="v1566" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1566" tabindex="-1">v1566</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz siner e nicht enhat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1567" id="v1567" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1567" tabindex="-1">v1567</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so muze wir doch mit schänden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
