         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1568" id="v1568" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1568" tabindex="-1">v1568</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>disen lip verwandeln<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1569" id="v1569" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1569" tabindex="-1">v1569</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so si mit I den steinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1570" id="v1570" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1570" tabindex="-1">v1570</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zupoln unser geboino<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1571" id="v1571" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1571" tabindex="-1">v1571</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so müz mich rüwen di vart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1572" id="v1572" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1572" tabindex="-1">v1572</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich ie so alt wart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1573" id="v1573" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1573" tabindex="-1">v1573</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz muze got erbarmen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1574" id="v1574" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1574" tabindex="-1">v1574</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
