         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir sagen dir herre waz tu scholt tu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1577" id="v1577" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1577" tabindex="-1">v1577</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4242
