         </span>wanne got andir glukc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1581" id="v1581" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1581" tabindex="-1">v1581</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>siner barmunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1582" id="v1582" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1582" tabindex="-1">v1582</a>
