         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu laze daz gut wesen sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1673" id="v1673" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1673" tabindex="-1">v1673</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz I dich got erweit hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1674" id="v1674" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1674" tabindex="-1">v1674</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an den tougenliche rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1675" id="v1675" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1675" tabindex="-1">v1675</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dine ur immer gerne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1676" id="v1676" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1676" tabindex="-1">v1676</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4410
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit vlize und mit ercn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1677" id="v1677" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1677" tabindex="-1">v1677</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4411
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als I du seist ur eigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1678" id="v1678" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1678" tabindex="-1">v1678</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4412
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des enschaltu nicht gewei gern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1679" id="v1679" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1679" tabindex="-1">v1679</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4413
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den sun den si gewinnet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1680" id="v1680" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1680" tabindex="-1">v1680</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4414
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und in di werlt brin get<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1681" id="v1681" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1681" tabindex="-1">v1681</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wirt gcheizen ihc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1682" id="v1682" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1682" tabindex="-1">v1682</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4423
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sunde kan er alsus<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1683" id="v1683" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1683" tabindex="-1">v1683</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4424
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lesschen und swenden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4425
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1684" id="v1684" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1684" tabindex="-1">v1684</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4426
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz di lutc mak gescheijden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1685" id="v1685" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1685" tabindex="-1">v1685</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4427
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des tuvols ruge und sin clage<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1686" id="v1686" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1686" tabindex="-1">v1686</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem iungisten tage<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
