         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di warheit ich dir stelle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1688" id="v1688" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1688" tabindex="-1">v1688</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er ledigz uns von der helle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1689" id="v1689" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1689" tabindex="-1">v1689</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sinen willen haben getan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1690" id="v1690" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1690" tabindex="-1">v1690</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der himel ist in uf getan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1691" id="v1691" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1691" tabindex="-1">v1691</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und alliz daz da ie ge wart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1692" id="v1692" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1692" tabindex="-1">v1692</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist geseinet und bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1693" id="v1693" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1693" tabindex="-1">v1693</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von I siner mankrefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1694" id="v1694" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1694" tabindex="-1">v1694</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und mit der herschefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1695" id="v1695" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1695" tabindex="-1">v1695</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der nimmer wirt ein ende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1696" id="v1696" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1696" tabindex="-1">v1696</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da mahtudin dinst wol bewendc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1697" id="v1697" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1697" tabindex="-1">v1697</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ioseph der einvalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1698" id="v1698" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1698" tabindex="-1">v1698</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nicht lenger er enwalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1699" id="v1699" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1699" tabindex="-1">v1699</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin I vreude wart so michel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
