         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1700" id="v1700" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1700" tabindex="-1">v1700</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>io was er worden sicher<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1701" id="v1701" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1701" tabindex="-1">v1701</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor allem ungemüte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1702" id="v1702" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1702" tabindex="-1">v1702</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von des engeis gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1703" id="v1703" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1703" tabindex="-1">v1703</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di I wunder hiz er scriben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1704" id="v1704" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1704" tabindex="-1">v1704</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unser vrouwen sant ma rien<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1705" id="v1705" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1705" tabindex="-1">v1705</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bot er sich zu fuzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1706" id="v1706" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1706" tabindex="-1">v1706</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprach wi wol mich muzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1707" id="v1707" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1707" tabindex="-1">v1707</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sunde immer ruwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1708" id="v1708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1708" tabindex="-1">v1708</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich dich misseltruwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1709" id="v1709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1709" tabindex="-1">v1709</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
