         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4694
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>trank zu dem ersten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1733" id="v1733" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1733" tabindex="-1">v1733</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4695
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ane sorge er dar wr<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1734" id="v1734" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1734" tabindex="-1">v1734</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4696
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er enivorhte nicht daz er verlür<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
