         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lip oder sele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1736" id="v1736" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1736" tabindex="-1">v1736</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>io gedachte er an di lere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1737" id="v1737" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1737" tabindex="-1">v1737</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di um der engel zu sprach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1738" id="v1738" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1738" tabindex="-1">v1738</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do er zu iimgest sach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1739" id="v1739" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1739" tabindex="-1">v1739</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di freute sine gedauk<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1740" id="v1740" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1740" tabindex="-1">v1740</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do hub er ufe und trank<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
