         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eine schenke groze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1742" id="v1742" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1742" tabindex="-1">v1742</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4711
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor sine husgenozen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1743" id="v1743" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1743" tabindex="-1">v1743</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4712
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do stunt er ane wende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1744" id="v1744" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1744" tabindex="-1">v1744</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4713
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si derwischten in bi der \ hende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1745" id="v1745" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1745" tabindex="-1">v1745</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4714
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
