         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4729
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wa«n si di bosheit nie gerou<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1757" id="v1757" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1757" tabindex="-1">v1757</a>
