         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4733
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bischof rette mit ir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1760" id="v1760" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1760" tabindex="-1">v1760</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4734
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz urkunde kisen wir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1761" id="v1761" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1761" tabindex="-1">v1761</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4735
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an diu selbis libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1762" id="v1762" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1762" tabindex="-1">v1762</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4736
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu sage wer dich zu wibe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1763" id="v1763" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1763" tabindex="-1">v1763</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4737
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit schänden hab gemachet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1764" id="v1764" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1764" tabindex="-1">v1764</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4738
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des dm ouge lachet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1765" id="v1765" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1765" tabindex="-1">v1765</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4739
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des mochtes du baz weinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
