         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4745
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di wolyses sulchen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1769" id="v1769" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1769" tabindex="-1">v1769</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4746
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sazte an di buch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1770" id="v1770" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1770" tabindex="-1">v1770</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4747
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du endarß I uns nicht versuchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
