         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du turrest lougen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1772" id="v1772" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1772" tabindex="-1">v1772</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du I hast gefrumet tougen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1773" id="v1773" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1773" tabindex="-1">v1773</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz schinet an dir da vor we<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
