         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4753
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'von dem gotis zorne'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1775" id="v1775" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1775" tabindex="-1">v1775</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4754
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di maget in antworte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1776" id="v1776" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1776" tabindex="-1">v1776</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4755
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit gezognlichen worten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1777" id="v1777" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1777" tabindex="-1">v1777</a>
