         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si sprach ich enhab des nicht 1 etan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1780" id="v1780" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1780" tabindex="-1">v1780</a>
