         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4761
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got weiz min unischulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1782" id="v1782" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1782" tabindex="-1">v1782</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4762
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und hab ich gotis hulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1783" id="v1783" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1783" tabindex="-1">v1783</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4763
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so müz min rat werden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1784" id="v1784" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1784" tabindex="-1">v1784</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4764
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er enlezet mich nicht dersterben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1785" id="v1785" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1785" tabindex="-1">v1785</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4765
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hab aber ich ge sundet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1786" id="v1786" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1786" tabindex="-1">v1786</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4766
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich so bin enzundet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1787" id="v1787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1787" tabindex="-1">v1787</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4767
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit werltlichem füre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1788" id="v1788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1788" tabindex="-1">v1788</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
