         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von welchen diugen daz mochte gesiu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1829" id="v1829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1829" tabindex="-1">v1829</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4832
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des uam si wunder alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4833
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4834
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1830" id="v1830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1830" tabindex="-1">v1830</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4835
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do si SU zuvalle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1831" id="v1831" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1831" tabindex="-1">v1831</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ane schult brachten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1832" id="v1832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1832" tabindex="-1">v1832</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil leide si in gedachten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1833" id="v1833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1833" tabindex="-1">v1833</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des 1 heiligen crists blume<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
