         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di wolte do mit gefuge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1835" id="v1835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1835" tabindex="-1">v1835</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4841
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von deme teidinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1836" id="v1836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1836" tabindex="-1">v1836</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4842
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ur ganzen ere bringe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1837" id="v1837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1837" tabindex="-1">v1837</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4843
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si vorchten 1 di vertanen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1838" id="v1838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1838" tabindex="-1">v1838</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4844
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si mit bösem arkwane<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1839" id="v1839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1839" tabindex="-1">v1839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4845
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dannoch wrten ir haz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1840" id="v1840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1840" tabindex="-1">v1840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4846
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>richten wolten si baz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1841" id="v1841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1841" tabindex="-1">v1841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4847
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do swur si majnige eyde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1842" id="v1842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1842" tabindex="-1">v1842</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4848
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di enwarn nicht meyne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1843" id="v1843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1843" tabindex="-1">v1843</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4849
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den grimmi gen luten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1844" id="v1844" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1844" tabindex="-1">v1844</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
