         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'di ie komen zu''''"" gote'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1847" id="v1847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1847" tabindex="-1">v1847</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4853
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di in deme himele swebten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1848" id="v1848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1848" tabindex="-1">v1848</a>
