         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der bürge veste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1851" id="v1851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1851" tabindex="-1">v1851</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4857
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
