         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4866
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si alliz falsches ane<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1859" id="v1859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1859" tabindex="-1">v1859</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4867
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an allen zwivel were<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1860" id="v1860" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1860" tabindex="-1">v1860</a>
