         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4871
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und aller bösen dinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1862" id="v1862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1862" tabindex="-1">v1862</a>
