         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4877
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si bat ur got so helfe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1867" id="v1867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1867" tabindex="-1">v1867</a>
