         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf gereke sinen vinger<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1916" id="v1916" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1916" tabindex="-1">v1916</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so smeher noch so geringer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1917" id="v1917" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1917" tabindex="-1">v1917</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>was oueh nimant in der werlt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1918" id="v1918" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1918" tabindex="-1">v1918</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4973
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er muste daz keiserlich gezelt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1919" id="v1919" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1919" tabindex="-1">v1919</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit schacze eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1920" id="v1920" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1920" tabindex="-1">v1920</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den vronen hort gemeren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1921" id="v1921" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1921" tabindex="-1">v1921</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di uz gevarn waren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4978
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4979
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4980
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4982
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1922" id="v1922" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1922" tabindex="-1">v1922</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4983
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di musten heim gahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4984
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1923" id="v1923" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1923" tabindex="-1">v1923</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4985
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu irn vrunden und zu irn kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1924" id="v1924" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1924" tabindex="-1">v1924</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4986
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz man si gesament funde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1925" id="v1925" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1925" tabindex="-1">v1925</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4987
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so man di brife machen schölte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1926" id="v1926" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1926" tabindex="-1">v1926</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4988
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wi I der herre wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1927" id="v1927" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1927" tabindex="-1">v1927</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4989
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz dri pfenninge wak<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1928" id="v1928" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1928" tabindex="-1">v1928</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4990
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so cz uffe der wage lak<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1929" id="v1929" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1929" tabindex="-1">v1929</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4991
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gab ein iclich man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1930" id="v1930" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1930" tabindex="-1">v1930</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4992
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der daz leben ivol\te han<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1931" id="v1931" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1931" tabindex="-1">v1931</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4993
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sich wolte weren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1932" id="v1932" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1932" tabindex="-1">v1932</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4994
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den erslugen di scherggn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1933" id="v1933" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1933" tabindex="-1">v1933</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di daz gelt enpfingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1934" id="v1934" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1934" tabindex="-1">v1934</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und wr di fursten giengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1935" id="v1935" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1935" tabindex="-1">v1935</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4997
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit scinslicliom horte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1936" id="v1936" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1936" tabindex="-1">v1936</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4998
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si brachten in sinem Worte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1937" id="v1937" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1937" tabindex="-1">v1937</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4999
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>guldine sule<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1938" id="v1938" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1938" tabindex="-1">v1938</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5000
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und giiladene mule<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1939" id="v1939" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1939" tabindex="-1">v1939</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5001
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>8 di wageue aljso veste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5002
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1940" id="v1940" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1940" tabindex="-1">v1940</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5003
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si musten nid er brosto<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1941" id="v1941" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1941" tabindex="-1">v1941</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5004
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von des scliaczes sweie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1942" id="v1942" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1942" tabindex="-1">v1942</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5005
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der dem helde mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1943" id="v1943" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1943" tabindex="-1">v1943</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5006
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gcfuret warn zusamene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1944" id="v1944" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1944" tabindex="-1">v1944</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5007
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in sine treskamere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1945" id="v1945" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1945" tabindex="-1">v1945</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5008
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do wart ein kreftiger vride<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1946" id="v1946" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1946" tabindex="-1">v1946</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di swert musten si versniide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1947" id="v1947" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1947" tabindex="-1">v1947</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5011
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>beide spize und sper<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1948" id="v1948" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1948" tabindex="-1">v1948</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do enwas kein her<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1949" id="v1949" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1949" tabindex="-1">v1949</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz innner des gedeclite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5015
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1950" id="v1950" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1950" tabindex="-1">v1950</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5016
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz es sich undervehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1951" id="v1951" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1951" tabindex="-1">v1951</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5017
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do enwas niebt urleuges<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1952" id="v1952" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1952" tabindex="-1">v1952</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5018
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi des meres puwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1953" id="v1953" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1953" tabindex="-1">v1953</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5019
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nocb kein nitgeselle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1954" id="v1954" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1954" tabindex="-1">v1954</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5020
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit grozer ebenhelle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1955" id="v1955" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1955" tabindex="-1">v1955</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5021
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und harte vrideliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1956" id="v1956" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1956" tabindex="-1">v1956</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5022
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>stunden alle di riche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1957" id="v1957" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1957" tabindex="-1">v1957</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5023
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di senfte und di stille<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1958" id="v1958" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1958" tabindex="-1">v1958</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5024
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di was des kindes wille<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1959" id="v1959" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1959" tabindex="-1">v1959</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5025
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz bi der maget was verboln<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5026
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5027
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5028
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5029
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5030
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5031
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1960" id="v1960" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1960" tabindex="-1">v1960</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5032
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der keiserliche zol<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1961" id="v1961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1961" tabindex="-1">v1961</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5033
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sint di warnen dri<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1962" id="v1962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1962" tabindex="-1">v1962</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5034
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di uns habent gevriet hie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5035
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5036
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5037
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5038
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1963" id="v1963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1963" tabindex="-1">v1963</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5039
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol wir di ich underschcide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1964" id="v1964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1964" tabindex="-1">v1964</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5040
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
