         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5628
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und derriten ez so schire<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2156" id="v2156" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2156" tabindex="-1">v2156</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5629
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor vorchten was in leide und libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2157" id="v2157" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2157" tabindex="-1">v2157</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5630
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do sprach daz kint edelc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2158" id="v2158" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2158" tabindex="-1">v2158</a>
