         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5632
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den kunige ez was gesippc<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2160" id="v2160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2160" tabindex="-1">v2160</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5633
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doch wolte ez in di \ krippe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2161" id="v2161" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2161" tabindex="-1">v2161</a>
