         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7264
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2187" id="v2187" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2187" tabindex="-1">v2187</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7266
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Sint daz der heilant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2188" id="v2188" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2188" tabindex="-1">v2188</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7267
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ons ze helfe wart gesant 70<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2189" id="v2189" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2189" tabindex="-1">v2189</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>fint beginc er zeichen also vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2190" id="v2190" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2190" tabindex="-1">v2190</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich enmac noch enwil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2191" id="v2191" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2191" tabindex="-1">v2191</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mich daran swingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2192" id="v2192" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2192" tabindex="-1">v2192</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich si wre bringe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2193" id="v2193" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2193" tabindex="-1">v2193</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>scholte ich si volleclichen sage 75<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2194" id="v2194" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2194" tabindex="-1">v2194</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7273
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so endorfte ich nimmer gedagen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2195" id="v2195" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2195" tabindex="-1">v2195</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wr war sage ich eu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2196" id="v2196" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2196" tabindex="-1">v2196</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz di buch alleu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2197" id="v2197" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2197" tabindex="-1">v2197</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di wir lesen und singen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2198" id="v2198" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2198" tabindex="-1">v2198</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von deme einen urspringe 80<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2199" id="v2199" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2199" tabindex="-1">v2199</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu samene sint gevlogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2200" id="v2200" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2200" tabindex="-1">v2200</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil wol im daz getochte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2201" id="v2201" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2201" tabindex="-1">v2201</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er di wunder vegingh<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2202" id="v2202" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2202" tabindex="-1">v2202</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich weiz wol sin gelich wart nie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2203" id="v2203" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2203" tabindex="-1">v2203</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und nimmer enwirt 85<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2204" id="v2204" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2204" tabindex="-1">v2204</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7283
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wer sinen dinst verbirt <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2205" id="v2205" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2205" tabindex="-1">v2205</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der muz den tot kisen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2206" id="v2206" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2206" tabindex="-1">v2206</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7285
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und di sele ewicliche verlisen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2207" id="v2207" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2207" tabindex="-1">v2207</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7286
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Der heilant hiz di stummen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2208" id="v2208" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2208" tabindex="-1">v2208</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7287
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di suchtigin zungen 90<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2209" id="v2209" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2209" tabindex="-1">v2209</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7288
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sprechen und singen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2210" id="v2210" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2210" tabindex="-1">v2210</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7289
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di hufhalzen springen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2211" id="v2211" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2211" tabindex="-1">v2211</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7290
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di krumme wurden wol gesunt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2212" id="v2212" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2212" tabindex="-1">v2212</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7291
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wo sin vil heiliger munt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2213" id="v2213" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2213" tabindex="-1">v2213</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein einigiz wort sprach 95<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2214" id="v2214" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2214" tabindex="-1">v2214</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so er di sichen uber sach <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2215" id="v2215" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2215" tabindex="-1">v2215</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da was trost und heil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2216" id="v2216" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2216" tabindex="-1">v2216</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und aller mandunge deil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2217" id="v2217" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2217" tabindex="-1">v2217</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7296
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hiz di selben blinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2218" id="v2218" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2218" tabindex="-1">v2218</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7297
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vinster uber winden 100<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2219" id="v2219" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2219" tabindex="-1">v2219</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7298
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vervallen oren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2220" id="v2220" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2220" tabindex="-1">v2220</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7299
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di hiz er wol geboren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2221" id="v2221" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2221" tabindex="-1">v2221</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7300
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wo er di miselsucht begreif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2222" id="v2222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2222" tabindex="-1">v2222</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7301
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und den luten st gesleif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7302
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2223" id="v2223" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2223" tabindex="-1">v2223</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7303
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz fiver und di werndesucht 105<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2224" id="v2224" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2224" tabindex="-1">v2224</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7304
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di musten keren an die flucht <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2225" id="v2225" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2225" tabindex="-1">v2225</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7305
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di ermochten um nicht vorgehaben <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2226" id="v2226" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2226" tabindex="-1">v2226</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7306
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hiz di toten uz den graben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2227" id="v2227" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2227" tabindex="-1">v2227</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7307
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil gewalticlich ersten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2228" id="v2228" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2228" tabindex="-1">v2228</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7308
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und in ir herberge gen 110<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2229" id="v2229" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2229" tabindex="-1">v2229</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7309
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Di tuvele-suchtigh waren <br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7310
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7311
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2230" id="v2230" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2230" tabindex="-1">v2230</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7312
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di musten im gnaden <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2231" id="v2231" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2231" tabindex="-1">v2231</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7313
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wanne st der bose geist verlie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2232" id="v2232" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2232" tabindex="-1">v2232</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7314
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz er wolte daz ergie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2233" id="v2233" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2233" tabindex="-1">v2233</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7315
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alliz nach siner hulde 115<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2234" id="v2234" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2234" tabindex="-1">v2234</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7316
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sunde unde schulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2235" id="v2235" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2235" tabindex="-1">v2235</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7317
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di vertreip er von den brusten <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2236" id="v2236" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2236" tabindex="-1">v2236</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7318
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di siner gute lusten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2237" id="v2237" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2237" tabindex="-1">v2237</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7319
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von funf girstnen broten <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2238" id="v2238" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2238" tabindex="-1">v2238</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7320
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di er gesegenote 120<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2239" id="v2239" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2239" tabindex="-1">v2239</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7321
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>darzu hiz er mische<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2240" id="v2240" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2240" tabindex="-1">v2240</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7322
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zwene wenige vische<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2241" id="v2241" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2241" tabindex="-1">v2241</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7323
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>funf tusent manne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2242" id="v2242" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2242" tabindex="-1">v2242</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7324
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di gesat er do dannen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7325
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2243" id="v2243" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2243" tabindex="-1">v2243</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7326
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit gotlichen eren 125<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2244" id="v2244" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2244" tabindex="-1">v2244</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7327
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si der luste mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2245" id="v2245" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2245" tabindex="-1">v2245</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7328
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der geistlichen spise <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2246" id="v2246" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2246" tabindex="-1">v2246</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7329
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wirt was so wise <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2247" id="v2247" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2247" tabindex="-1">v2247</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7330
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zwelf korbe hiz er nemen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2248" id="v2248" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2248" tabindex="-1">v2248</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7331
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di brosmen dar in legen 130<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2249" id="v2249" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2249" tabindex="-1">v2249</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7332
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si wurde alle ensament vol <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2250" id="v2250" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2250" tabindex="-1">v2250</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7333
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gevil der werlde wol<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2251" id="v2251" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2251" tabindex="-1">v2251</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7334
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Vaste vreute sich daz her <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2252" id="v2252" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2252" tabindex="-1">v2252</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7335
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ofte ginc er uffe dem mer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2253" id="v2253" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2253" tabindex="-1">v2253</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7336
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit trukenen fuzen 135<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2254" id="v2254" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2254" tabindex="-1">v2254</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7337
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir daran muzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2255" id="v2255" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2255" tabindex="-1">v2255</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7338
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erkennen sinen gewalt <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2256" id="v2256" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2256" tabindex="-1">v2256</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7339
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er zu kunige ist gezalt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2257" id="v2257" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2257" tabindex="-1">v2257</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7340
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob aller herschefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2258" id="v2258" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2258" tabindex="-1">v2258</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7341
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er schulte mit siner krefte 140<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2259" id="v2259" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2259" tabindex="-1">v2259</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7342
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu samene di erde <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2260" id="v2260" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2260" tabindex="-1">v2260</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7343
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als si an eime vademe were <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2261" id="v2261" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2261" tabindex="-1">v2261</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7344
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diz ist michel und groz <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2262" id="v2262" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2262" tabindex="-1">v2262</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7345
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wer mochte wesen sin gnoz ?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2263" id="v2263" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2263" tabindex="-1">v2263</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7346
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an allen sinen werken 145<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2264" id="v2264" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2264" tabindex="-1">v2264</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7347
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mugen wir gnade merken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2265" id="v2265" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2265" tabindex="-1">v2265</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7348
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di erzeigte er uns besunder <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2266" id="v2266" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2266" tabindex="-1">v2266</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7349
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und scholte ich di wunder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2267" id="v2267" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2267" tabindex="-1">v2267</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7350
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle bescriben und beduten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2268" id="v2268" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2268" tabindex="-1">v2268</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7351
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den kunstigen luten  150<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2269" id="v2269" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2269" tabindex="-1">v2269</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7352
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der iungen wil ich geswigen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2270" id="v2270" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2270" tabindex="-1">v2270</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7353
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmochte min zunge nicht erliden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2271" id="v2271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2271" tabindex="-1">v2271</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7354
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Di wazersucht er heilte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2272" id="v2272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2272" tabindex="-1">v2272</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7355
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gnade er uns teilte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2273" id="v2273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2273" tabindex="-1">v2273</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7356
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit michelem vollen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2274" id="v2274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2274" tabindex="-1">v2274</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7357
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di lute di vewollen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2275" id="v2275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2275" tabindex="-1">v2275</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7358
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit dem blute waren <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2276" id="v2276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2276" tabindex="-1">v2276</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7359
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er gebot daz si genasen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2277" id="v2277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2277" tabindex="-1">v2277</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7360
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er was an an allen dingen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2278" id="v2278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2278" tabindex="-1">v2278</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7361
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als wir lesen und singen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2279" id="v2279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2279" tabindex="-1">v2279</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7362
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil rechter demute <br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7363
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7364
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7365
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7366
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7367
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2280" id="v2280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2280" tabindex="-1">v2280</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7368
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von den brusten siner gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2281" id="v2281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2281" tabindex="-1">v2281</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7369
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>liz er di gute sugen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2282" id="v2282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2282" tabindex="-1">v2282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7370
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di armen und di blugen (sic)<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2283" id="v2283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2283" tabindex="-1">v2283</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7371
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di griffen an sine wat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2284" id="v2284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2284" tabindex="-1">v2284</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7372
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den wart des slechtumes rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2285" id="v2285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2285" tabindex="-1">v2285</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7373
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des volgte harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2286" id="v2286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2286" tabindex="-1">v2286</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7374
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin volk er wol bewarte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2287" id="v2287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2287" tabindex="-1">v2287</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7375
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di mit rechtem glouben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2288" id="v2288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2288" tabindex="-1">v2288</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7376
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>komen vor sine heiligen ougen 170<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2289" id="v2289" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2289" tabindex="-1">v2289</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7377
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do der heilant entſlif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2290" id="v2290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2290" tabindex="-1">v2290</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7378
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und in die menige anrif <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2291" id="v2291" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2291" tabindex="-1">v2291</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7379
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di uffe des mers wage<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2292" id="v2292" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2292" tabindex="-1">v2292</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7380
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in grozer fraise lagen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2293" id="v2293" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2293" tabindex="-1">v2293</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7381
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als er di ceswe uf bot 175<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2294" id="v2294" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2294" tabindex="-1">v2294</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7382
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so was gestillet alle not <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2295" id="v2295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2295" tabindex="-1">v2295</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7383
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hiz di ſweren winde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2296" id="v2296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2296" tabindex="-1">v2296</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7384
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von sinen liben kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2297" id="v2297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2297" tabindex="-1">v2297</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7385
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>entwichen also schire<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2298" id="v2298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2298" tabindex="-1">v2298</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7386
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sinen iungeren uffe dem kile 180<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2299" id="v2299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2299" tabindex="-1">v2299</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7387
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den was di lichte sunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2300" id="v2300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2300" tabindex="-1">v2300</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7388
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil snelle uf errunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2301" id="v2301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2301" tabindex="-1">v2301</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7389
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des meres unde freiſſam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2302" id="v2302" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2302" tabindex="-1">v2302</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7390
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di warn irm herren undertan <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2303" id="v2303" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2303" tabindex="-1">v2303</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7391
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die scharfen wint stoze 185<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2304" id="v2304" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2304" tabindex="-1">v2304</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7392
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und alliz daz gedoze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2305" id="v2305" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2305" tabindex="-1">v2305</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7393
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz erkante sinen meister<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7394
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2306" id="v2306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2306" tabindex="-1">v2306</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7395
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und muz ouch im gehorsam leiste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2307" id="v2307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2307" tabindex="-1">v2307</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7396
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nach allen disen eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2308" id="v2308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2308" tabindex="-1">v2308</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7397
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>liz sich der milte herre 190<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2309" id="v2309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2309" tabindex="-1">v2309</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7398
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di iuden vahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2310" id="v2310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2310" tabindex="-1">v2310</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7399
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und an daz cruce hahen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2311" id="v2311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2311" tabindex="-1">v2311</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7400
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>damite er uns erloste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2312" id="v2312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2312" tabindex="-1">v2312</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von des tuvels roste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2313" id="v2313" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2313" tabindex="-1">v2313</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der von hicze welle 195<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2314" id="v2314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2314" tabindex="-1">v2314</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> darin gevellet <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2315" id="v2315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2315" tabindex="-1">v2315</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ist ewiclich verlorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2316" id="v2316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2316" tabindex="-1">v2316</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der were bezer ni geborn <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2317" id="v2317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2317" tabindex="-1">v2317</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er koufte uns also ture<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2318" id="v2318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2318" tabindex="-1">v2318</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von deme helle vure 200<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2319" id="v2319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2319" tabindex="-1">v2319</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von deme alten nide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2320" id="v2320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2320" tabindex="-1">v2320</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit sin selbis libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
